   "widgets_values": [
    "CHARACTER CONCEPT -- 4-step Lightning, ~30s\n\nFor rolling through ideas.  Change the seed in KSampler to reroll.\n\nTHE NEGATIVE BOX DOES NOTHING HERE.  The distilled 4-step model runs at\ncfg 1.0, where there is no classifier-free guidance to steer with --\nso the second CLIPTextEncode is inert whatever you type in it.  Put\neverything in the positive, or switch to txt2img_qwen for a real one.\n\n---\n\nQwen-Image 4-step, using the PRE-MERGED Lightning checkpoint\nrather than applying the LoRA at runtime. Both Apache-2.0. The\nmerge is not a convenience: applying the bf16 LoRA to the fp8\nbase makes ComfyUI dequantize the affected layers to patch them,\nand that spike OOMs a 16GB card every time. A pre-merged\ncheckpoint has nothing to patch. cfg MUST stay 1.0 - a distilled\nmodel has no classifier-free guidance to steer, so the negative\nprompt does nothing here; put everything in the positive.\n1104x1472 is Qwen's 3:4, which keeps a standing figure head-to-\ntoe; a square crops at mid-thigh and a cropped concept makes a\ncropped mesh."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
